{"id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-simply-typed-lambda.md","title":"Simply Typed Lambda Calculus","display":"df-simply-typed-lambda — Simply Typed Lambda Calculus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","aliases":["72-df-simply-typed-lambda"],"display":"df-simply-typed-lambda — Simply Typed Lambda Calculus","depends_on":["[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]","[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, ch.3 print14–20; Handbook X print692/PDF704 (contextual reference)","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-simply-typed-lambda</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simply-typed-lambda — Simply Typed Lambda Calculus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, ch.3 print14–20; Handbook X print692/PDF704 (contextual reference)"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a> 的有限自由树、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 类及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_\\lambda\">\\(\\beta_\\lambda\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf B=\\mathsf{Base}\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf B=\\mathsf{Base}\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=V_t\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=V_t\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 遍历有限偏函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\to}\">\\(V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\to}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:A\">\\(\\Gamma,x:A\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\)</span> 时表示扩充。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_\\to=\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\to\\times\\Lambda_\\to\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\">\\(U_\\to=\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\to\\times\\Lambda_\\to\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\\)</span>。规则分数编码和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;:=\\mathsf B,&amp;T_{n+1}&amp;:=T_n\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in T_n\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to&amp;:=\\bigcup_nT_n,\\\\\nL_0&amp;:=V_t,&amp;L_{n+1}&amp;:=L_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in L_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to,M\\in L_n\\},&amp;\\Lambda_\\to&amp;:=\\left(\\bigcup_nL_n\\right)/{=_\\alpha},\\\\\nR_\\to&amp;:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B}\\right\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_\\to}(R_\\to),\\\\\n\\lambda^\\to&amp;:=\\langle\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to,\\Lambda_\\to,\\vdash_\\to,\\beta_\\lambda\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;:=\\mathsf B,&amp;T_{n+1}&amp;:=T_n\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in T_n\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to&amp;:=\\bigcup_nT_n,\\\\\nL_0&amp;:=V_t,&amp;L_{n+1}&amp;:=L_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in L_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to,M\\in L_n\\},&amp;\\Lambda_\\to&amp;:=\\left(\\bigcup_nL_n\\right)/{=_\\alpha},\\\\\nR_\\to&amp;:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B}\\right\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_\\to}(R_\\to),\\\\\n\\lambda^\\to&amp;:=\\langle\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to,\\Lambda_\\to,\\vdash_\\to,\\beta_\\lambda\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>语法先由有限构造迭代产生，typing由零前提变量规则和两个构造规则的最小闭包产生；没有预设待定义类型集或typing已存在。上下文中未使用假设允许存在，但变量不能同时赋予两个类型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]] 的有限自由树、$\\alpha$ 类及 $\\beta_\\lambda$。$\\mathsf B=\\mathsf{Base}\\ne\\varnothing$，$\\mathsf{Var}=V_t$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma$ 遍历有限偏函数 $V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\to}$；$\\Gamma,x:A$ 只在 $x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma$ 时表示扩充。$U_\\to=\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\to\\times\\Lambda_\\to\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to$。规则分数编码和 $\\operatorname{Cl}$ 来自 [[72-df-types-inference-closure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf B=\\mathsf{Base}\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=V_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,x:A","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"U_\\to=\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\to\\times\\Lambda_\\to\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&:=\\mathsf B,&T_{n+1}&:=T_n\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in T_n\\},&\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to&:=\\bigcup_nT_n,\\\\\nL_0&:=V_t,&L_{n+1}&:=L_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in L_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to,M\\in L_n\\},&\\Lambda_\\to&:=\\left(\\bigcup_nL_n\\right)/{=_\\alpha},\\\\\nR_\\to&:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B}\\right\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_\\to}(R_\\to),\\\\\n\\lambda^\\to&:=\\langle\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to,\\Lambda_\\to,\\vdash_\\to,\\beta_\\lambda\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2325,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-295","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda|df-simply-typed-lambda — Simply Typed Lambda Calculus]]"},{"id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$；类型、项与类型代入分别使用 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]、[[72-df-system-f]]。命题语法就是相应类型语法，原子与类型变量逐一同名。$\\Gamma$ 是变量标记假设的有限偏函数。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-295","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-simply-typed-lambda|df-simply-typed-lambda — Simply Typed Lambda Calculus]]"},{"id":"3a355fde5140d919","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\to}M:A$、合法项集与 $\\beta_\\lambda$ 取自 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]。$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Normal}_R$ 见 [[72-df-normalization-proof]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-214","lo